#: ../../source/index.rst:39 87401eeb3b3e47b99d14a059e36f3559
msgid ""
":ref:`Hardware <stores>`  is the peripheral sensors, controller, and output "
"devices that act as the vehicle's eyes, ears, brain and arms."
msgstr ""
":ref:`硬件 <stores>` 指构成载具感知、决策与执行能力的外设传感器、控制器与输出器件——可以理解为载具的眼睛、耳朵、大脑和手臂。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:42 3afaf9ed3ee3416f88fb8283dc3298bd
msgid ""
"Almost any mobile machine can be transformed into an autonomous vehicle, by "
"simply integrating a small hardware package into it. Hardware packages begin"
" with a controller."
msgstr "几乎任何可移动的机械都可以通过集成一套小型硬件包改造为自主载具。硬件包以控制器为核心。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:46 b64786c0bab54d5c9411a12d3f1c5e84
msgid ""
"Using inputs from sensors, the controller is able to send outputs to devices"
" such as ESC's, servos, gimbals and other peripherals."
msgstr "控制器接收传感器输入，并向 ESC、舵机、云台等外设输出控制信号。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:60 6b1851d7953845ba87d411f5856ac5cc
msgid ""
":ref:`Firmware <common-downloads_firmware>` is the code running on the "
"controller. You choose the firmware to match your vehicle and mission: "
":ref:`Copter <copter:home>`, `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__, :ref:`Rover <rover:home>`, Sub,"
" or :ref:`Antenna Tracker <antennatracker:home>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`固件 <common-downloads_firmware>` "
"是运行在控制器上的代码。请根据你的载具与任务选择对应固件：:ref:`Copter <copter:home>`、`Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__、:ref:`Rover <rover:home>`、Sub 或 "
":ref:`Antenna Tracker <antennatracker:home>`。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:64 09aadde6a854489fa6883db026c149fa
msgid "The choice is yours -- one autopilot for any mission."
msgstr "选择权在你——一套飞控适配所有任务。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:77 a6d643b585e3411da522c7bcc92ebdff
msgid ""
":ref:`Ground Control Station <common-choosing-a-ground-station>` (GCS) is "
"your interface to the controller. Various versions of GCS software are "
"available for Window's, Linux, and Android platforms."
msgstr ""
":ref:`地面站 <common-choosing-a-ground-station>`（GCS）是你与控制器交互的界面。地面站软件有适用于 "
"Windows、Linux 与 Android 平台的多种版本。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:80 64ce93741f6745368cb280d40771ac87
msgid ""
"A GCS allows users to set-up, configure, test, and tune the vehicle. "
"Advanced packages allow autonomous mission planning, operation, and post-"
"mission analysis."
msgstr "地面站允许用户对载具进行安装、配置、测试与调参。高级地面站还支持自主任务规划、执行与任务后数据分析。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:84 c391eee7cb9b48ecaf67281ac17a68c6
msgid ""
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` is a full-featured GCS supported by "
"ArduPilot. It offers point-and-click interaction with your hardware, custom "
"scripting, and simulation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Mission Planner <planner:home>` 是 ArduPilot "
"支持的一款全功能地面站。它提供点选式的硬件交互方式，支持自定义脚本与仿真。"

