#: ../../source/index.rst:156 fea2537ada1a4a7181a5bfd0cf24769b
msgid "History"
msgstr "历程"

#: ../../source/index.rst:158 0d0988cb339240599d82b3d7ec3a53bd
msgid ""
"The DIYDrones community provided an initial home for ArduPilot. From those "
"hobbyist beginnings, ArduPilot led the professionalisation of the Open "
"Source drone community by creating DroneCode. Since leaving DroneCode in "
"2016 ArduPilot has grown further to stand as an independent, open, global "
"project. The comprehensive and ever growing list of ArduPilot features are "
"continually born from the needs of the community - be they hobbyists, "
"commercial users, academics, or the largest of enterprises. See the "
":ref:`history-of-ardupilot` for more information."
msgstr ""
"DIYDrones 社区为 ArduPilot 提供了最初的孵化平台。从这种业余爱好者社区起步，ArduPilot 通过创立 DroneCode "
"推动了开源无人机社区的专业化进程。2016 年退出 DroneCode 后，ArduPilot "
"进一步成长为一个独立、开放、全球化的项目。ArduPilot "
"全面且不断丰富的功能列表，源自社区的真实需求——无论是业余爱好者、商业用户、学术研究者，还是大型企业。更多信息请参见 :ref:`history-of-"
"ardupilot`。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:166 d64759b68afe4d6582c1e7cbeb171f1d
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:175 ccc2d0851104431ca564f01dac05f1f3
msgid ""
"Thorough documentation of the available features backed by a community to "
"help you set up any vehicle to fit your needs"
msgstr "完善的功能文档加上一个能帮你针对任意载具完成所需配置的社区"

#: ../../source/index.rst:177 087ca74ddf7e43b289a5288a6368c6ad
msgid ""
"Many command modes to fit every type of vehicle: Acro, Stabilize, Loiter, "
"Alt-hold, Return To Launch, Land, Follow Me, GeoFence, etc."
msgstr ""
"适配各种载具的多种指令模式：Acro、Stabilize、Loiter、Alt-Hold、Return To Launch、Land、Follow "
"Me、GeoFence 等等。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:180 a36a9601d9eb4e97923d5eb9d0c257dd
msgid ""
"Autonomous flight modes that execute fully scripted missions with advanced "
"features."
msgstr "支持完整脚本化任务的自主飞行模式，并具备高级功能。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:182 d98f86ceef064d9abdaf3634735be7bb
msgid ""
"Advanced failsafe options bring peace of mind in the event of lost control "
"signal, low battery conditions, or other system failures."
msgstr "在丢失控制信号、电量不足或其他系统故障时，先进的失控保护选项让你安心。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:184 91582d27a1964420bb4827ed9abbe702
msgid ""
"Three Axis camera control and stabilization, shutter control, live video "
"link with programmable on-screen-display"
msgstr "三轴相机控制与增稳、快门控制、可在屏显（OSD）上自定义的实时视频图传"

#: ../../source/index.rst:194 3a82e05930044b9ea7e548b52db81a1a
msgid ""
"Real-time two-way communication between your GCS and controller, including "
"GPS position, battery status, and other live information."
msgstr "地面站与控制器之间的实时双向通信，包括 GPS 位置、电池状态以及其他实时信息。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:196 55db442a347d42a2a4f5314dccab1c10
msgid ""
"Full data logging for comprehensive post mission analysis, with graphing and"
" Google Earth mapping tools"
msgstr "完整的数据记录用于任务后综合分析，配合绘图与 Google Earth 地图工具"

#: ../../source/index.rst:198 98b0cbf12aca47e382f44ef3f8f2d5d1
msgid ""
"Industry leading control algorithms for vehicles of all types, with robust "
"sensor compensation algorithms, filtering and tuning capabilities"
msgstr "适配各种载具的业界领先控制算法，配套稳健的传感器补偿算法、滤波与调参能力"

#: ../../source/index.rst:201 f3203b084ede4d6ca5a963b3e5ab6de0
msgid ""
"No dead ends -- Advanced users will find endless options for customization "
"and expanded mission capabilities"
msgstr "毫无瓶颈——高级用户可获得无穷无尽的自定义与扩展任务能力选项"

#: ../../source/index.rst:272 ab455a4ec53a40ac91d711e6cbbe092b
msgid "last build |today|"
msgstr "最近一次构建 |today|"

